# Environment / secrets.
# `.env` matches ONLY that exact name — it does not cover .env.smtp,
# .env.staging or any other suffix. `.env*` catches every variant.
.env*
# Keep committed templates. Negations MUST come after the pattern they
# re-include, or git ignores them.
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template

